{"product_id":"eleaf-istick-100w-tc-vape-system","title":"Eleaf iStick 100W TC Vape Mod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Eleaf iStick 100W Box Mod is a powerful and compact device designed for reliable everyday use. Delivering up to 100 watts of output and powered by two high-rate 18650 batteries (not included), it offers long-lasting performance with excellent consistency. Featuring variable wattage, durable stainless steel threads, and a spring-loaded 510 connector, the iStick 100W ensures versatility and durability. With a wide resistance range and enhanced ventilation for heat dissipation, this device is suitable for both beginner and advanced vapers looking for efficiency and style in one box mod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iStick-TC100W_07.gif?v=1763432778\" alt=\"eleaf istick 100w vape mod - battery area\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput wattage range: 5–100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage range: 2–10V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance range: 0.15–5O\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePowered by two 18650 batteries (not included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable stainless steel 510 connector with spring pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnhanced ventilation for safer performance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and ergonomic design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s Inside:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 × Eleaf iStick 100W Box Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 × USB Cable (for charging and firmware updates)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 × User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Batteries (\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeparately given\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp